# Go standards

Apply `coding-standards` references: `naming.md`, `coding.md`, plus `api-services.md` or `background-services.md` by command type (`cmd/api` vs `cmd/worker`).

Hard requirements: `context.Context` first; wrap errors with `%w`; small packages; godoc on exported symbols.
